1
00:04:57,000 --> 00:05:03,000
Whatever they dream up... he has to survive.

2
00:09:54,000 --> 00:10:00,000
Bedtime Stories is a fantasy, comedy, family film directed by Adam Shankman.

3
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:57,000
Skeeter Bronson is a down-on-his-luck guy who's always
telling bedtime stories to his niece and nephew.

4
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:54,000
But his life is turned upside down when the fantastical stories he
makes up for entertainment inexplicably turn into reality.

5
00:24:45,000 --> 00:24:51,000
Can a bewildered Skeeter manage his own unruly fantasies now that the outrageous characters
and situations from his mind have morphed into actual people and events?

6
00:29:42,000 --> 00:29:48,000
Skeeter Bronson, played by Adam Sandler.

7
00:34:39,000 --> 00:34:45,000
Jill, played by Keri Russell.

8
00:39:36,000 --> 00:39:42,000
Kendall, played by Guy Pearce.

9
00:44:33,000 --> 00:44:39,000
Wendy, played by Courteney Cox.

10
00:49:30,000 --> 00:49:36,000
Aspen, played by Lucy Lawless.

11
00:54:27,000 --> 00:54:33,000
Hot Girl, played by Carmen Electra.

12
00:59:24,000 --> 00:59:30,000
Bedtime Stories is a 2008 American fantasy comedy film directed by Adam Shankman from
a screenplay by Matt Lopez and Tim Herlihy based on a story by Lopez.

13
01:04:21,000 --> 01:04:27,000
It stars Adam Sandler in his first appearance in a family film, alongside Keri Russell, Guy Pearce, Aisha
Tyler, Russell Brand, Richard Griffiths, Teresa Palmer, Lucy Lawless, and Courteney Cox.

14
01:09:18,000 --> 01:09:24,000
In the film, a hotel handyman's stories to his niece and nephew
come true, and his stories become more outlandish.

15
01:14:15,000 --> 01:14:21,000
Sandler's production company Happy Madison Productions and Andrew Gunn's
company Gunn Films co-produced the film with Walt Disney Pictures.

16
01:19:12,000 --> 01:19:18,000
The film premiered on December 25, 2008, by Disney.

17
01:24:09,000 --> 01:24:15,000
Despite the film being a box office success, earning $212.9 million against an $80
million budget, it received generally negative reviews from critics.

18
01:29:06,000 --> 01:29:12,000
The film explores themes of wishes come true, escapade,
disorder, imaginary, miraculous event.

19
01:34:03,000 --> 01:34:09,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
